# Responsible Social Media Use – Checklist

Stay safe, respectful, and smart while using social media.

---

## Do’s

- Think before you post  
- Use strong and unique passwords  
- Verify information before sharing  
- Maintain a professional online presence  
- Respect others’ privacy  

---

## Don’ts

- Do not share personal or sensitive information  
- Avoid posting offensive or inappropriate content  
- Do not engage in cyberbullying or arguments  
- Don’t accept requests from unknown people  
- Avoid excessive use of social media  

